description:
This is a critical role, working in close conjunction with the Head of Project Delivery and Head of Power, to lead solar projects delivery and operations, both ground\-mounted and rooftop, offsite as well as onsite projects, primarily in India but also in Southeast Asia.


The person will be responsible for reviewing and validating, energy yield assessments \& electrical system designs submitted by EPC contractors, ensuring compliance, safety, and execution quality. Experienced in Design Engineering of Rooftop, Carport \& Ground Mount Solar PV as well as Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) Projects.


**Key Responsibilities:**


* Conduct site surveys and assess client load profiles for solar PV system sizing;
* Perform energy yield assessments using tools like PVsyst or Helioscope \& similar;
* Proficiency with tools such as SolarGIS, Homer Pro, ETB, Google Sketchup will be added advantage;
* Support pre\-sales technical evaluations and feasibility screening of potential sites;
* Review electrical system designs including SLDs, layouts, cable schedules, and protection schemes;
* Validate EPC submissions for compliance with international and local electrical codes and safety standards;
* Assess grid interconnection designs, SCADA systems, and metering arrangements;
* Evaluate transformer sizing, inverter configurations, and earthing systems, power system studies;
* Conduct technical due diligence and risk assessments for electrical components;
* Ensure proper integration of electrical systems with civil and structural designs;
* Prepare and enforce strong MQAP's, FAT's, FQAP's, robust testing practices \& reporting framework;
* Monitor site execution plans and ensure alignment with approved electrical designs;
* Provide expert feedback to EPCs on constructability, quality, and safety by conducting regular site visits during construction;
* Work closely with Owner's Engineers, Lender's Engineers, and Consultants;
* Support internal teams with electrical engineering insights during project development and execution; and
* Maintain documentation and support audits and reporting processes.


**Other Position requirements**


* Job located in Pune (India);
* Travelling in India, and occasionally in Southeast Asia;
* Bachelor's degree in electrical engineering, Renewable Energy, or related field;
* 8\-10 years successful experience in electrical engineering roles within solar PV or renewable energy projects;
* Strong knowledge of solar PV systems, grid integration, energy storage solutions, protection coordination, and energy yield optimization;
* Spirit of dedication and teamwork;
* Resourceful and self\-driven;
* Prior involvement in projects across Thailand, Vietnam, and the Philippines is a plus;
* Familiarity with international standards (IS, IEC, IEEE) and regional electrical practices;
* Exposure to Wind Power and Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS) will be considered an added advantage; and
* Excellent communication and interpersonal skills.
